268
00:16:57,380 --> 00:17:02,560
Luffy even a little, then I'm
happy to die right here and now!

269
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:07,137
You're quite the piece
of work, aren't you?

270
00:17:07,220 --> 00:17:11,691
Tough it out a bit and I'll guard you
until you can use your barriers again.

271
00:17:15,980 --> 00:17:17,862
You don't have any manners, huh?

272
00:17:18,980 --> 00:17:20,720
Cinco monos! Time to fetch!

273
00:17:27,300 --> 00:17:28,680
I know how you feel.

274
00:17:28,980 --> 00:17:30,340
I'm with you, Brewster.

275
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:37,560
Our captain is something special.

276
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,977
I'd risk anything for him.

277
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:44,380
Even my life.

278
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:11,440
Luffy's our trump card.

279
00:18:11,660 --> 00:18:13,500
He's our key to victory.

280
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:19,600
Mio fleur.

281
00:18:20,260 --> 00:18:21,400
Gigantesco mano.

282
00:18:41,340 --> 00:18:43,617
You're not laying a finger on my captain.

283
00:18:43,700 --> 00:18:49,760
No more screwing around.

284
00:18:50,480 --> 00:18:52,117
You're quite the odd one.

285
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:54,477
Weren't you trying to stall us?

286
00:18:54,560 --> 00:18:56,557
It doesn't seem like you
should be complaining—how

287
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:59,217
long are you gonna keep
this act up, old man?

288
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:00,130
Old

289
00:19:00,500 --> 00:19:04,397
man he says, well that's not
my only disadvantage frankly,

290
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:07,657
I prefer to take things easy.

291
00:19:07,740 --> 00:19:10,497
I don't discriminate among my enemies.

292
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:11,410
Scary

293
00:19:13,620 --> 00:19:18,417
kid though, I don't suppose you got your
position by being kind to the elderly.

294
00:19:18,500 --> 00:19:19,330
elderly

295
00:19:19,900 --> 00:19:20,880
Fair enough.

296
00:19:21,380 --> 00:19:24,262
My position doesn't require
me to be kind either.

297
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:26,480
Don't hold this one against me.

298
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:29,500
Gravity blade.

299
00:19:36,460 --> 00:19:37,840
Raging Tiger!

300
00:19:51,980 --> 00:19:53,098
Horizontal gravity?

301
00:19:56,300 --> 00:19:57,560
I thought so.

302
00:19:57,840 --> 00:19:59,134
You were holding back.

303
00:20:01,840 --> 00:20:04,520
The problem is, I still don't know why.

304
00:20:21,220 --> 00:20:25,777
you might say this is an
all-or-nothing gamble for me and

305
00:20:25,860 --> 00:20:29,377
the stakes are as big as they get
i'm laying my life on the line

306
00:20:29,460 --> 00:20:34,137
for this one that said i have to
get my dice in order to make my

307
00:20:34,220 --> 00:20:38,140
roll because if i lose them the
game is over before it even starts

308
00:20:47,340 --> 00:20:52,837
this is deplorable Rebecca
you coward why do you

309
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:57,297
keep running you're a fighter
aren't you sorry I mean

310
00:20:57,380 --> 00:21:01,617
gladiator I thought you
were coming here to kill me

311
00:21:01,700 --> 00:21:06,380
we put on some good entertainment
back at the Coliseum, didn't we?

312
00:21:07,780 --> 00:21:12,960
But if you won't fight me properly,
it's time I dispose of you.

313
00:21:37,900 --> 00:21:41,697
Well, you have nowhere to run now.

314
00:21:41,780 --> 00:21:45,317
Hmm, I know.

315
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:48,780
Let's make this a little more poetic.

316
00:21:51,800 --> 00:21:56,817
Rebecca wasn't your mother,
also—shot with a gun!

317
00:21:56,900 --> 00:21:57,730
gun

318
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:03,060
Please, help me, soldier!

319
00:22:05,700 --> 00:22:06,540
Rebecca!

320
00:22:12,720 --> 00:22:14,560
Wait, it can't be!

321
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:17,640
Kilos!

322
00:22:20,140 --> 00:22:22,080
Keep your hands off her.

323
00:22:22,540 --> 00:22:24,780
You have taken enough from me!

324
00:22:27,940 --> 00:22:30,646
This statue before you,
this man was a legend.

325
00:22:31,060 --> 00:22:35,472
He was the greatest gladiator in the
whole history of the Corrida Coliseum.

326
00:22:50,380 --> 00:22:52,968
I regret I couldn't
save your mother's life,

327
00:22:53,320 --> 00:22:56,791
but I will devote mine to
protect yours, whatever the cost.

328
00:22:59,860 --> 00:23:01,360
Become strong, Rebecca!

329
00:23:09,520 --> 00:23:10,350
Father...

330
00:23:10,433 --> 00:23:12,160
Please forgive me, Rebecca.

331
00:23:13,580 --> 00:23:15,560
As a mere toy without a future,

332
00:23:15,900 --> 00:23:19,018
the only thing I could do
was teach you how to fight.

333
00:23:19,760 --> 00:23:21,440
I know it was hard on you.

334
00:23:21,700 --> 00:23:24,229
You're a gentle soul
just like your mother.

335
00:23:27,400 --> 00:23:29,165
But you need no longer suffer.

336
00:23:30,980 --> 00:23:31,810
Now,

337
00:23:33,180 --> 00:23:34,380
I'll fight for you.

338
00:23:43,580 --> 00:23:45,760
You want to elaborate on that?

339
00:23:46,620 --> 00:23:47,450
Kiros!

340
00:23:47,620 --> 00:23:48,914
I won't just stand by.

341
00:23:49,080 --> 00:23:51,256
I'll make you pay for your treachery!

342
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:03,860
I'll kill you!

343
00:24:09,200 --> 00:24:10,600
Rebecca!

344
00:24:15,100 --> 00:24:16,500
Lucy?

345
00:24:24,500 --> 00:24:25,330
Rebecca!

346
00:24:27,700 --> 00:24:28,580
Lucy!

347
00:24:28,840 --> 00:24:29,760
You made it!

348
00:24:34,800 --> 00:24:35,680
Rebecca!

349
00:24:38,600 --> 00:24:39,780
The key!

350
00:24:41,520 --> 00:24:42,350
Lucy!

351
00:24:42,433 --> 00:24:44,397
You're safe, thank goodness!

352
00:24:44,480 --> 00:24:45,310
What is this?

353
00:24:56,480 --> 00:24:57,310
The key!

354
00:24:57,560 --> 00:24:59,000
Give it to me!

355
00:25:01,500 --> 00:25:02,860
It's right here!

356
00:25:07,180 --> 00:25:08,480
Go, now!

357
00:25:09,480 --> 00:25:10,310
Rebecca!

358
00:25:16,380 --> 00:25:29,890
Ah!

359
00:25:31,860 --> 00:25:33,380
Thru! Thru!

360
00:25:52,260 --> 00:25:53,090
Yes!

361
00:25:53,173 --> 00:25:54,460
Get back here!

362
00:25:56,360 --> 00:25:58,260
We made it, finally!

363
00:25:58,900 --> 00:26:00,580
I'm free, finally.

364
00:26:03,420 --> 00:26:06,540
So this is the fourth
level where Mingo's hiding.

365
00:26:06,940 --> 00:26:08,940
Let's tear this place apart!

366
00:26:09,800 --> 00:26:10,630
Yeah.

367
00:26:11,060 --> 00:26:11,890
Law!

368
00:26:11,973 --> 00:26:12,960
Straw Hat!

369
00:26:13,180 --> 00:26:15,180
It's Diamante. Eeeh!

370
00:26:16,800 --> 00:26:17,630
Eeeh!

371
00:26:20,480 --> 00:26:22,300
You two go ahead without me!

372
00:26:22,560 --> 00:26:24,678
I've got a score to settle with him!

373
00:26:26,800 --> 00:26:28,200
Kill that bastard!

374
00:26:28,620 --> 00:26:29,840
In my stead!

375
00:26:30,540 --> 00:26:31,980
Leave it to me!
